<item>
            <title>[LU-19929] RISC-V Architecture Support</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19929</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;RISC-V is gaining significant momentum in the HPC community. Currently Lustre is not supported on RISC-V architecture.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is has been raised and discussed on lustre-devel mailing list here: &lt;a href=&quot;http://lists.lustre.org/pipermail/lustre-devel-lustre.org/2026-February/011349.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://lists.lustre.org/pipermail/lustre-devel-lustre.org/2026-February/011349.html&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Creating this Jira issue is created to reference in the RISC-V patches.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
